; =============================================================================
; PROYECTO  : Lover Lips Yachts — Owner Dashboard
; ARCHIVO   : .env.example  [DEPRECATED — 2026-07-31]
; =============================================================================
; This was an early-phase fossil template (predates index.php, describes
; a static index.html SPA, and lists PAYPAL_/STRIPE_ keys never used
; anywhere in this codebase). It also pointed at the retired
; lly.tourfindy.com staging host. Nothing in the app reads this file —
; api/conexion.php reads core/.env exclusively.
;
; The current, accurate template is core/.env.example (mirrored by
; core/.env for real local values). The only official production domain
; is loverlipsyachts.com. See docs/02_SYSTEM_CODEX_REGISTRY.md.
; =============================================================================
